 * Category: IRS / Federal Tax
 * Primary Keyword: IRS tax refund estimator
 * Secondary Keywords: federal tax refund calculator, estimate tax refund 2026,
 *   will I get a tax refund, tax refund calculator for seniors, how much will my refund be
 *
 * Page Title: IRS Tax Refund Estimator 2026 — Estimate Your Refund | Seniors Audit (66 chars ✓)
