        <span class="rfe-related-desc">Determine exactly what percentage of your Social Security benefit is subject to federal income tax.</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/retirement-tax-estimator/" class="rfe-related-card">
        <span class="rfe-related-title">Retirement Tax Estimator</span>
        <span class="rfe-related-desc">Project your annual federal tax liability from retirement income before estimating a refund or amount owed.</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/ira-withdrawal-tax-calculator/" class="rfe-related-card">
        <span class="rfe-related-title">IRA Withdrawal Tax Calculator</span>
        <span class="rfe-related-desc">Model the federal tax impact of a traditional IRA withdrawal before you take the distribution.</span>
